WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:08.500
The path climbs into mountains where broken watchtowers cling to the cliffs.

2
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:17.100
Lightning leaps between their roofs, carrying stolen pieces of the Crown’s magic toward the capital.

3
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:28.000
Your spellbook opens to a page you have never seen: a dragon curled around a chain of shining numbers.

4
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:32.400
Beneath it, one sentence appears:

5
00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:37.900
<b>A steady mind can wake what thunder cannot.</b>

6
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:42.400
Act II: The Long Country · Levels 11–20
